        <imixs:item name="rtfmailbody" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[Dear Customer,

we are sorry to inform you that we are not able to deliver your product on expected delivery date because of product scarcity. Please be patient and saty with us untill you recieve a second email from us. Thank you. Best Wishes.]]></imixs:value>
